```

Key choices: 16 experts × top-2 with 4096-wide expert FFNs over 24 layers of width 2048 gives ~1.2B active params/token (the "1B dense-equivalent" compute class) with ~6.9B total. EP=16 (1 expert/GPU) on 32 GPUs keeps DP=2 and eliminates expert-replication, while TP=1 avoids over-sharding the small attention blocks.